    <td width="187" valign="top"><p align="center"><img src="Graphics/05ab67c0.jpg" alt="TAPS" width="177" height="128" align="texttop"></p>      
      <p><span class="style4">JPO's Vision: </span><span class="style26"><strong>To work proactively with Alaska's oil and gas industry to safely operate, protect the environment, and continue transporting oil and gas in compliance with legal requirements. </strong></span>
</p>            <hr />
<span class="style4">HotLine: 800-764-5070 </span><span class="style26"><strong>JPO hosts a toll-free hotline for people to anonymously report concerns. Names of callers are kept confidential to the maximum extent provided by law. JPO staff are not given this information unless it is needed to resolve the issue and the caller gives permission for its release.</strong></span>      <hr />
<p align="center"><span class="style28"><span class="style31">Goverment Employment </span><br>
